e,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"任务开始位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/1057c038f957149dbbddf498428d0e23_8905969163177515405.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1371","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:22px\\\"\u003e〓路线攻略〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e具体路线攻略推荐：\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/36350461\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e珐露珊邀约攻略\u003c/a\u003e  作者：\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/accountCenter/postList?id=82367888\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\"\u003e橙柒柒\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd1 过去的故事\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/c0c06c956e164ff6a81164f6e12f59dc_2930615688910031390.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e早已过去的故事，如今也在熠熠生辉。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd2 知识就是财富！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/9ebd794856e240d100c535fe204667c2_5305141343980102065.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e只要是知识，总会有用处。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd3 园丁与苗圃\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/27c1e830797aba90136e2c2a10ce4ece_315835572185516345.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e「只要乐于求知，就算不在我门下也无所谓...\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e不过真的不能再考虑一下吗？知论派的课也很有意思的！」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-a